   "titulo": "I think, I think",
   "texto": [
    "In claims like **Acho que vai chover** (I think it will rain), **acho que** and **penso que** are usually followed by the sign.",
    "To say that something seems likely, use **parece que**: **Parece que vai fazer sol** (it seems to make it sun)."
   ]
