  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Doubts and certainties",
   "texto": [
    "**Talvez** (perhaps) and **se calhar** (perhaps, very used in Portugal): **Se calhar tens razão** (perhaps you are right).",
    "To say that you are safe or safe, say **tenho a certeza** (I am certain). To say you're not, say **tenho dúvidas** (I have doubts)."
   ]
